  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening resilience in Syria SRI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilience program in Northwest and Northeast-Syria implemented by Care Norway, Mercy Corps and International Rescue Committee. Agriculture, livelihood, access to markets and market development. Activities include rehabilitation of agricultural land where ways to contribute to water supply and water management are central.
Vulnerable groups, women and disabled people are among the target groups of the programme. Humanity and inclusion (HI) is one of the organizations in the consortium.</narrative>
  </description>
